:: objectives-system [script nobr]
/*
  OBJECTIVE SYSTEM
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  The core add/complete/clear widgets already live in
  src/ui/widgets.tw (<<addObjective>>, <<completeObjective>>,
  <<clearObjectives>>) since they're generic UI widgets shared
  by every day. This file is reserved for objective-related
  logic that grows beyond simple add/complete   e.g. chained
  objectives, day-specific objective sets, or side-quest
  branching tables   once day content needs it.
*/
